         <h1 class="hero-image__title">
            Meet the Team         </h1>

                     <p class="hero-image__subtitle">
               sFOX is built by operators, engineers, and market experts who have spent decades navigating traditional and digital financial systems. We don't just participate in digital asset markets—we build the infrastructure that makes them work for institutions.            </p>
         
         
